Package: ducksemantics
Type: Package
Title: DuckDB-Native Semantic and Retrieval Relations
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "Sounkou Mahamane", family = "Toure",
           email = "sounkoutoure@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person(given = "Human Phenotype Ontology", role = "cph",
           comment = "Bundled README fixture (CC BY 4.0)")
    )
Description: DuckDB-native ontology graphs, validated Human Phenotype Ontology
    (HPO) observations, typed release-cataloged Monarch relations including
    read-only projections of attached dated packs, provider/snapshot-catalog-bound
    literature retrieval, and source-grounded semantic judgments. Bulk values
    are ordinary relations; optional S7 protocols are reserved for real prompt,
    embedding, parser, and annotator providers. The package does not store
    ClinVar or PubMed source data, download Monarch packs, rank cases, or
    evaluate benchmarks.
